    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Join us as we celebrate the impressive achievements of our students and alumni at the Annual Journalism Excellence Awards,2024 presented by Media Council of Kenya. This remarkable award was presented to some of our MADJ students and Media Lab team alumnus as well. These extraordinary students epitomized the highest standards of the craft, captivating audiences with their compelling storytelling, and unwavering commitment to truth. Their accomplishment is a testament to the exceptional training and mentorship provided by the Graduate School of Communication.",
